comments[38]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-11T13:52:31.175Z","harness:claude-code","Reproduced in production on 2026-08-11, and it blocked the scheduled daily cut.\n\nSequence, all times UTC:\n\n- 04:02:48 the scheduled Auto Release run 31457243436 checked out main. HEAD was 3791ff12f74ff3f09c6062adca92ab8848d57ba7, a single-parent commit with no associated pull request.\n- 04:02:52 pull request 972 merged as 39d60f244779e8c4a451948988a0facbc48df824, four seconds after the checkout.\n- 04:09:37 hosted-analysis-gate refused with reason \"DeepScan status is missing for the exact commit\". The candidate carried exactly one commit status, codecov/patch, and no DeepScan or CodeFactor check run. Both fallbacks were unavailable: no second parent, and no pull request whose tree matched.\n- 04:09:38 blocker issue 973 opened. RECORDED_FAILURE_STAGE was hosted-analysis-gate, so the pm-x63izf fix reported the gate's own verdict rather than the preflight guess.\n- 04:12:23 blocker 973 closed, retry run 31457749989 started, checked out 39d60f24, and the same gate passed through the matching-pull-request fallback.\n- 04:21:18 v2026.8.11 tagged. npm shows 2026.8.11 as latest, and all three npx and bunx dispatch forms run it.\n\nSo the release succeeded only because the candidate changed between the two attempts. Nothing about 3791ff12 became releasable, and nothing ever will.\n\nPopulation measured the same day against the commits API rather than a subject-line heuristic: of the 103 commits on main since 2026-08-04, 37 have no associated pull request. That is 36 percent. main's HEAD at the time of measurement, 250b4030b4d246bdb6cb5f3ffb1fd1949be013c5, is one of them, so the default branch was sitting in an unreleasable state in the middle of an ordinary working day with no surface reporting it.\n\nThat last point is the half this item's acceptance criteria did not yet cover. AC1 requires the release pipeline to report releasability before it builds, which is a check inside a release attempt. Between attempts there is a window of up to 24 hours in which main is unreleasable and the only thing that will ever say so is tomorrow's 04:02 run. A new criterion has been added for that.\n"
  "2026-08-15T04:14:50.218Z","harness:codex","Production reproduction 2026-08-15: scheduled Auto Release run 31861502082 on main 592e5918 failed after exact coverage, packed npx, and package-first dogfood because DeepScan status was missing for the exact commit. Blocker GH-1017 is the live external report. PR #1016 is now merged at 26feeed14; no v2026.8.15 tag/package exists, so same-day uniqueness remains intact while this canonical item is actively fixed."
  "2026-08-15T04:19:42.982Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: hosted-analysis now emits a structured reviewed_pull_request_analyzer_evidence contract, succeeds for merge commit 26feeed14809 via identical-tree reviewed head e7e9b86afd7c, and explicitly refuses failed direct-main SHA 592e5918ca36 before build. Auto Release performs the check before toolchain setup; CI exposes Release analyzer readiness (main) on every product-relevant push. Focused unit/integration suite passed 79/79."
  "2026-08-15T04:38:17.090Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: exact coverage passed across 500 files and 7,338 tests at statements 53,346/53,346, branches 39,357/39,357, functions 10,957/10,957, and lines 51,514/51,514. The repository-wide static quality pipeline passed, including build, package boundary, SDK parity, surface replication, tracker context, gate registry, SDK/CLI cost snapshots, graph composition, and record integrity."
  "2026-08-15T04:40:06.541Z","harness:codex","Manual isolated evidence: pnpm dogfood:package-first created /tmp/pm-dogfood-fp3TcV, installed the packed CLI and packages, and passed 88 commands including init, extension installation, package scaffolding/typecheck, linked-test execution, and upgrade flows. pnpm typecheck passed all core, type-test, package, and example projects. pnpm security:scan found no credential-like secrets in tracked files."
  "2026-08-15T04:41:31.898Z","harness:codex","Delivery: PR #1018 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1018 carries the release analyzer provenance contract at initial implementation commit d834f23d4. Hosted checks and exact-head bot review are pending; the item remains in progress until merge and release recovery evidence are complete."
  "2026-08-15T05:14:05.212Z","harness:codex","Review loop evidence: CodeRabbit identified three valid findings on PR #1018. The implementation now requires the merge parent to equal the unique reviewed PR head before identical-tree analyzer evidence can be reused, refuses an analyzer-clean identical-tree direct-push merge without that association, disables persisted checkout credentials in the main-readiness job, and records coverage through the canonical sandbox runner. Focused tests pass 90/90; current exact coverage passes 500 files and 7,339 tests at 100/100/100/100; repository static quality passes with CodeFactor-parity complexity 16 or lower."
  "2026-08-15T05:30:02.199Z","harness:codex","Hosted CI feedback: exact-head Gates (static) exposed a jscpd-only duplicate in the new regression mocks that the earlier repository-static-quality command does not cover. Consolidated reviewed-PR fixture construction into a documented multi-use helper. pnpm lint now passes ESLint, zero jscpd clones, CodeFactor-parity/static quality, SDK import/transport costs, graph composition, and record integrity. Current exact coverage remains 7,339/7,339 tests and 100/100/100/100. One concurrent benchmark attempt exceeded its timing ceiling under coverage contention; the required isolated rerun passed all 10 SDK entrypoint budgets."
  "2026-08-15T05:42:38.443Z","harness:codex","Post-merge integration finding: main CI run 31867504703 started Release analyzer readiness before GitHub exposed PR #1018's merge association and failed, while the same exact SHA 91f5b396e223 passed live moments later via reviewed head b33e6dc36 and identical tree fee777bd. The continuous job now needs build-foundation and uses always(), preserving failure visibility while allowing GitHub association propagation. Auto Release remains untriggered; v2026.8.15 and npm 2026.8.15 still do not exist."
  "2026-08-15T05:45:31.976Z","harness:codex","Propagation-fix verification: the release readiness job now needs build-foundation and retains always() push execution so GitHub has time to expose immutable PR association without hiding a failed build. The focused analyzer/workflow suite passes 80/80; pnpm lint:eslint and pnpm lint:duplicates pass with zero clones; pnpm quality:static passes the repository build, SDK/package parity, surface replication, tracker-context, gate-registry, cost baselines, graph composition, and record-integrity checks."
  "2026-08-15T05:46:14.719Z","harness:codex","Delivery continuation: PR #1022 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1022 carries the merge-association propagation fix at commit 9457b7b75. Hosted checks and exact-head reviews are pending; release recovery remains intentionally untriggered until this prerequisite is merged and proven on main."
  "2026-08-15T06:00:29.810Z","harness:codex","Second post-merge control: main run 31868126597 still refused SHA d1a420b9 after build-foundation because GitHub's commit-association endpoint remained eventually consistent, even though PR #1022's immutable resource already named merge SHA d1a420b9 and reviewed head 8df264fa9. Replaced timing dependence with deterministic merge-message discovery: the gate parses GitHub's standard merge PR number, then accepts it only when the PR API independently confirms closed+merged state, exact merge SHA, main base, valid reviewed head, and identical tree. The focused suite passes 81/81, live d1a420b9 provenance passes, ESLint passes, and jscpd reports zero clones."
  "2026-08-15T06:16:25.736Z","harness:codex","Deterministic-fallback verification: canonical coverage passed 500 files and 7,343 tests at statements 53,361/53,361, branches 39,371/39,371, functions 10,958/10,958, and lines 51,529/51,529. Repository static quality also passed build, package boundary, SDK parity, surface replication, tracker-context, gate registry, SDK/CLI cost baselines, graph composition, and append-only record integrity."
  "2026-08-15T06:16:57.173Z","harness:codex","Delivery continuation: PR #1023 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1023 carries deterministic merge-provenance validation at implementation commit 458cd2320. Release remains untriggered until exact-head hosted checks, review inventory, merge, and a successful main readiness control complete."
  "2026-08-15T06:38:36.030Z","harness:codex","Post-merge integration evidence: main CI run 31869377866 and its failed-job rerun 94976129763 both completed every other gate but failed Release analyzer readiness because the job token could not read main branch protection through GitHub REST. The same candidate ce82afe1ed9124ba71a51177b5d0d39463c5cde9 passes analyzer provenance live at reviewed head f6e962a50bfac576c6774a4e92c8be494a4f82d0. Recovery work keeps REST primary, falls back only on REST transport failure to GitHub's equivalent GraphQL branchProtectionRules query (separate quota pool), requires exactly one strict main rule containing CodeFactor and DeepScan, reports the transport source, and fails closed for missing, malformed, ambiguous, or unavailable policy data."
  "2026-08-15T06:48:23.076Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence for REST/GraphQL policy transport recovery: focused hosted-analysis and release-workflow contracts passed 89/89; the changed gate achieved exact 100/100/100/100 coverage. Canonical repository coverage then passed 500 files and 7,348 tests at statements 53,376/53,376, branches 39,381/39,381, functions 10,960/10,960, and lines 51,543/51,543. Repository static quality passed build, package boundaries, SDK parity, surface replication, docs/skills, token and context gates, SDK surface/cost snapshots, graph composition, tracker context quality, and append-only record integrity. ESLint and jscpd also passed with zero clones. Live candidate ce82afe1ed9124ba71a51177b5d0d39463c5cde9 remains releasable with exact policy and analyzer evidence."
  "2026-08-15T06:48:46.792Z","harness:codex","Delivery continuation: PR #1024 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1024 carries the quota-resilient branch-protection proof at commit f7e39d8c9. Hosted checks, exact-head bot review, exhaustive reaction/reply inventory, merge, live main readiness, and same-day release recovery remain pending; the item stays claimed and in progress."
  "2026-08-15T06:59:46.733Z","harness:codex","Review-loop finding: CodeRabbit correctly identified that the initial GraphQL recovery queried only branchProtectionRules(first:100), so a duplicate exact main rule on a later page could escape repository-wide uniqueness validation. The fix now uses gh GraphQL cursor pagination with slurped pages, validates each page's rules array, boolean termination state, and continuation cursor, refuses truncated or inconsistent page sequences, and evaluates exact-main uniqueness across all pages. Focused contracts pass 97/97; the gate remains exact 100/100/100/100 covered; ESLint and zero-clone jscpd gates pass."
  "2026-08-15T07:08:54.709Z","harness:codex","Post-review-fix verification: canonical repository coverage passed 500 files and 7,356 tests at statements 53,399/53,399, branches 39,396/39,396, functions 10,962/10,962, and lines 51,566/51,566. Repository static quality passed the full build, package/SDK boundaries, agent token and context gates, docs/skills, surface and transport snapshots, graph composition, tracker context quality, and append-only record integrity after pagination was added."
  "2026-08-15T07:29:44.240Z","harness:codex","Post-merge production control: PR #1024 merged as 18976c26e28fc9e5ab28338551e6ae6c6210af3c after every exact-head gate passed and every bot artifact was reacted to and answered. Main CI run 31871628567 then failed only Release analyzer readiness because the ephemeral GITHUB_TOKEN cannot read Administration-scoped branch protection through REST or admin GraphQL; every build, coverage, static, compatibility, smoke, and Windows job passed. GitHub's documented contents-readable GET /branches/main surface exposes effective protected status and required check contexts without the strict admin-only field. Recovery will keep admin REST and paginated GraphQL authoritative when available, then fail closed through the branch summary for protected state plus CodeFactor/DeepScan contexts while immutable exact/identical-tree provenance independently proves the release candidate tree. No release has been triggered."
  "2026-08-15T07:49:13.360Z","harness:codex","Restricted-token recovery verification: focused hosted-analysis and release-workflow contracts pass 107/107; the changed release gate is exact 100/100/100/100 covered. A real subprocess with REST and admin GraphQL forced unavailable passed only through the contents-readable branch summary for exact SHA 18976c26e, then negative controls correctly refused a different branch SHA and a missing CodeFactor context. A live maintainer-token run independently passed through REST with strict_verified=true and identical-tree reviewed head 8ab2a0e6e. Canonical repository coverage passes 500 files and 7,366 tests at statements 53,417/53,417, branches 39,422/39,422, functions 10,963/10,963, and lines 51,584/51,584. Repository static quality passes after an isolated SDK import-cost control confirmed the first 257ms/248ms timing excursion was transient contention; the full rerun passed package/SDK boundaries, surface replication, tracker context, gate registry, SDK and transport budgets, graph composition, and append-only record integrity."
  "2026-08-15T07:50:16.247Z","harness:codex","Delivery continuation: commit d06243372 implements the contents-readable effective-policy recovery after the production Actions-token denial, while preserving admin strictness proof and immutable analyzer-tree requirements. A follow-up PR, exact-head hosted checks/reviews, main readiness control, and the guarded same-day release remain pending; the item stays claimed and in progress."
  "2026-08-15T07:51:13.760Z","harness:codex","Delivery continuation: PR #1025 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1025 carries the restricted-token policy proof at implementation commit d06243372. Hosted checks, exact-head bot review, exhaustive reaction/reply inventory, merge, live main readiness, and same-day release recovery remain pending."
  "2026-08-15T08:36:48.242Z","harness:codex","Completion evidence: PR #1025 exact head a6276b2e72b00115b4ea1b125b3448e60cc6224e passed all hosted checks; five bot comments and the one bot review were each reacted to and individually answered, with zero review threads or actionable findings. Sourcery was rate-limited and Greptile produced no response, so neither is represented as approval. PR #1025 merged as a974dd1b27ffb9cda8a3aa6fb7e6946cbdc058fa. Exact main CI run 31873397261 then passed Release analyzer readiness under the restricted Actions token plus every build, coverage, static, compatibility, smoke, and Windows job. The one guarded Auto Release dispatch, run 31873678893, succeeded and published immutable v2026.8.15 at fbb7bd44d89d7d393b843e19f28dcb7f99367562. GitHub release and npm 2026.8.15 are public; npm integrity is sha512-tQxSeOVLOjmbcwQp7GZ55NvtbMw6KJyVmPMpfCwSTnQiEq9GofGFwKqP8dzgoN5etrvyKA13XZZypM0Kja4x1A==. verify-published passed; isolated installed-agent acceptance passed all 10 lifecycle steps under npm and Bun; explicit-version and default npx and bunx each reported 2026.8.15. The failed scheduled run had created no partial tag/package, so same-day uniqueness remained intact."
  "2026-08-15T08:45:55.750Z","harness:codex","Closeout CI finding: PR #1026 Gates (static) correctly refused the tracker-only close because CHANGELOG.md had not yet been regenerated after pm-u1baah became closed. npm reports pm-changelog 2026.8.12 as latest; the project installer activated that exact version, pnpm changelog:pm generated the Unreleased fix entry, and pnpm changelog:pm:check then reported unchanged."
  "2026-08-15T08:46:38.591Z","harness:codex","Closeout CI finding: PR #1026 Gates (static) correctly refused the tracker-only close because CHANGELOG.md had not yet been regenerated after pm-u1baah became closed. npm reports pm-changelog 2026.8.12 as latest; the project installer activated that exact version, pnpm changelog:pm generated the Unreleased fix entry, and pnpm changelog:pm:check then reported unchanged."
  "2026-08-16T07:03:41.855Z","harness:codex","Operational control 2026-08-16: main CI run 31924813173 at direct-main SHA cbc5ac21a440e5434669fe41de594b390d9a85e8 failed only Release analyzer readiness (main); every build, coverage, static, compatibility, smoke, and Windows job passed. The gate explicitly refused because no exact-commit or identical-tree reviewed-PR CodeFactor/DeepScan evidence existed. This is the shipped fail-closed policy working as designed, not analyzer approval or a regression; this delivery returns changes to main through a reviewed PR. Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/31924813173"
  "2026-08-17T13:58:02.549Z","harness:codex","Recurrence implementation: the compact agent rules, full agent guide, and release contract now treat PM evidence, item closure, and generated changelog as reviewed delivery artifacts. Evidence known pre-merge stays in the implementation PR; merge-SHA-dependent repository mutations require a normal main-based follow-up PR. Direct-main tracker/changelog closeout is explicitly forbidden because the resulting head has no reviewed analyzer provenance."
  "2026-08-17T14:00:00.683Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: pnpm build, docs/skills freshness, documentation link integrity, and secret scan pass. Focused analyzer and workflow contracts pass 109/109. The PM-linked docs/skills gate also passed and recorded its test run. The direct-main SHA remains the executable negative control; this branch is the normal reviewed recovery path."
  "2026-08-17T14:17:03.964Z","harness:codex","Exact-head hosted inventory finding on PR #1056: all repository checks passed, but the docs/tracker-only head received no CodeFactor, Semgrep, Hound, or CodeRabbit app check. Merging that head would not restore the external analyzer evidence required by release readiness. The recovery now adds an executable TypeScript contract for the reviewed-closeout policy, preserving the fail-closed gate while making policy regression and analyzer eligibility observable."
  "2026-08-17T14:18:28.417Z","harness:codex","Review-round remediation evidence: added a TypeScript integration contract that reads the compact agent guide, full agent guide, and release guide and refuses removal of the direct-main closeout prohibition, normal main-based follow-up path, or provenance-control interpretation. Focused analyzer/workflow contracts pass 110/110 and ESLint passes."
  "2026-08-17T14:31:22.627Z","harness:codex","Production recurrence 2026-08-17: PR #1056 exact head ed16b76d9 passed CodeFactor, CodeQL, Semgrep, and all repository gates, then squash-merged as 41af793f9. Main CI run 32039129691 failed Release analyzer readiness because GitHub returned an empty commits/41af793f9/pulls association during the job. The merge and reviewed head have identical tree 04692a24, while the canonical squash subject deterministically identifies (#1056). The existing fallback parses only classic 'Merge pull request #N' messages, leaving squash merges timing-dependent. Recovery will parse the strict terminal '(#N)' squash form, validate the PR resource independently against closed+merged state, exact merge SHA, main base, valid head, identical tree, and analyzer evidence, and preserve direct-main negative controls."
  "2026-08-17T15:00:04.739Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: focused hosted-analysis/workflow contracts pass 114/114. Full sandboxed coverage passes 515 files and 7,507 tests at statements 54,687/54,687, branches 40,815/40,815, functions 11,245/11,245, and lines 52,784/52,784. ESLint, zero-clone jscpd, repository static semantics, typecheck, docs/skills, secret scan, and production dependency audit pass. The local import-cost timing gate was not claimed green: unrelated desktop load averaged 10.75-14.20 and produced variable failures across different unchanged SDK entrypoints; the clean hosted gate remains mandatory."
  "2026-08-17T15:15:37.296Z","harness:codex","Review remediation: Sourcery identified that the deterministic squash fallback asserted provenance fields for success and missing DeepScan but not failing CodeFactor. Added a real failing CodeFactor check-run fixture and regression case asserting reason, analyzed_sha, and analysis_source. Focused hosted-analysis suite passes 91/91. PR #1057 will be updated and every review provider retriggered because the exact head changes."
  "2026-08-17T15:21:45.193Z","harness:codex","Hosted exact-head evidence after review remediation: CodSpeed passed on 6aa3ca496. The first CI attempt's source-executing jobs passed where reached; GitHub codeload 429/502/503 failures prevented three setup/download jobs. Static correctly failed for a repository-state reason: reopening this closed changelog-bearing item removed it from the generated closed-item view. Closing the completed remediation and regenerating CHANGELOG.md restores the deterministic contract before rerun."
  "2026-08-23T00:57:06.251Z","harness:codex","Recurrence evidence: Auto Release run 32606735961 created immutable tag v2026.8.23 at release commit 52a1f8f88e9e842215220eb79d8c453d5fc98a7f after the reviewed merge 719ba4126. Main CI run 32607463137 failed only Release analyzer readiness because the generated release commit had no exact or identical-tree PR evidence; Docs, CodeQL, OSSF, CodSpeed, and Security workflows passed. The tag remains immutable. Separately, tag Release run 32607462886 and exact-tag recovery 32608310364 both passed every pre-publish gate but npm rejected the publish PUT with E404/permission, leaving npm latest at 2026.8.22."
  "2026-08-23T01:21:49.985Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence for the 2026.8.23 recurrence repair: full lint and repository policy gates pass; canonical sandboxed coverage passes 563 files and 7,825 tests at statements 57,159/57,159, branches 42,760/42,760, functions 11,890/11,890, and lines 55,107/55,107. Typecheck, secret scan, production dependency audit, docs/skills, and documentation link checks pass. Live hosted-analysis execution accepts immutable release SHA 52a1f8f88e9e842215220eb79d8c453d5fc98a7f only as deterministic_release_transform, resolves reviewed analyzer SHA 64c333cc5634aba438fe03112358714ec80faceb through parent 719ba4126f9a670cf7b9fb4faf21f077d78e95a2, and reports exact_or_identical=false."
  "2026-08-23T01:41:18.667Z","harness:codex","Linked-test acceptance evidence: the all-linked default schema run passed 6/8 and intentionally caused repository-static-quality plus lint to fail closed because their defect-evidence subgate cannot operate on an empty schema tracker. Re-running each with --pm-context tracker --override-linked-pm-context seeded all 2,538 source items, reported mismatch_detected=false, and passed. The two tracker-dependent linked entries now persist pm_context_mode=tracker, so future canonical runs select the correct isolated tracker context without a run-level override."
